  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">COGER SARL Solar Energy Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sector: solar, Location: Acharim, Tagant region, Description: COGER plans to address the communitys lack of energy access by installing a 20-kilowatt solar-powered mini-grid and distribution network. COGER will sign an agreement with the community to pay for the electricity via a local guarantee. The local community will elect a management committee to help oversee the system. COGER will train the management committee as well as numerous local technical agents and collections agents on operations and maintenance as well as payment collection. The installation of the solar mini-grid will allow the population of Acharim and surrounding towns to have a source of energy to increase their productive capacity and income generating activities, including grocery stores, cold rooms, and wheat milling.</narrative>
  </description>
